The built-in GBA BIOS (`source/src/open_bios.h`, built from `source/bios/`)
is Normmatt's open-source replacement for the GBA BIOS, based on the VBA and
VBA-M HLE BIOS: Copyright (c) 2002-2006 VBA Development Team, (c) 2006-2013
VBA-M Development Team, (c) 2013 Normmatt. It is distributed under the GNU
General Public License, version 2 or any later version. The image is the one
libretro/gpsp and Nebuleon/ReGBA ship, and its source is ReGBA's;
`source/bios/README.md` records the provenance. Nintendo's BIOS is not
included.

Vendored zlib source retains its original notices. PSP SDK import libraries in
`source/SDK/` and the power library in `source/src/libpower/` are inherited
build dependencies from the upstream source snapshot.

Corresponding source code: every release carries
`GBA-Rush-PSP-<version>-source.zip` next to the binary zip. It is made from
the release's Git tag, named after the version, and holds every file of that
tag, including the BIOS sources in `source/bios/`. The zip has no Git history,
so a build from it takes the build id from the release's `.manifest.json`:
`make -C source BUILD_ID=<build_id>`.

